# Implement Frequency Encoding manually with pandas (no sklearn class for this one). Use only X_train to compute the frequency map — this matters, think about why. Apply the same map to a copy of X_train as a new column PaymentMethod_freq.

# TODO: compute value_counts(normalize=True) on X_train['PaymentMethod']
